     "html": "<p>Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<div data-block-id=\"block-1b650049-baea-4309-ac66-f28753056020\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If you want to provide your customers with increased absorption and an easier way to take their vitamins, liposomal technology can significantly benefit your product line.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Liposomal liquid technology is at the forefront of nutrient delivery systems, offering:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accelerated intestinal absorption</li>\n<li>Better protection and stability than other encapsulation technologies</li>\n<li>Better active ingredient bioavailability</li>\n<li>Ability to incorporate fat and water-soluble compounds into liposomes</li>\n<li>Controlled, uniform release of active ingredients</li>\n<li>Protects gut lining from irritation.</li>\n<li>Low toxicity and low allergenicity</li>\n</ul>\n<p>By private labeling products like our Liposomal Elderberry supplement, you can offer your customers superior-quality ingredients that are thoroughly tested for maximum efficacy.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Click below to download our guide and learn more about liposomal technology and its plethora of benefits.<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://f.hubspotusercontent30.net/hubfs/4087538/Liposomal%20Technology.pdf\" data-hs-link-id=\"1\"><strong>Download our Liposomal Technology Guide Here</strong></a></p>\n<p>*<em>This is a direct file download, you won't have to enter any additional information.*</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Specialists at <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> will help you brand and market top-tier supplements as your own, setting you apart in a crowded marketplace and giving you a competitive advantage.</p>\n</div>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
